      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Completely agree. My suggestion is to make separate tab \"Content Details\". In \"Content Manager\" tab make items have \"Open Details\" button which should open selected content in \"Content Details\" tab. The same In build tab: It's should not contain any info spam, only name and \"Build\" buttons, maybe also ID display. And should contain \"Open Details\" too, if blueprint already allocated. In \"Content Details\" all details like tags, description, ... Probably make it able to edit details from this tab.\n\nAlso move \"VRChat SDK\" logo into \"Auth\" tab.\n\nIn general, window with build tab opened, should only have minimum controls for building, should be able to be resized to small box, able to be mounted in some corner in layout w/o eating huge screen area.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
